From 507bdf6adcf059129f523583ec210c7ca58f8252 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthias Fend <matthias.fend@emfend.at>
Date: Fri, 12 Sep 2025 09:13:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] libcamera: Add support for camera flash devices

Add a class to model camera flash devices. Currently, only v4l2 flash
devices are supported. The v4l2 flash devices are implemented similar to
the camera lenses.

Signed-off-by: Matthias Fend <matthias.fend@emfend.at>
Reviewed-by: Isaac Scott <isaac.scott@ideasonboard.com>
---
